{'symbol': 'AES', 'date': '2021-09-28 08:16:00', 'title': 'FLUENCE FILES REGISTRATION STATEMENT WITH THE SEC FOR PROPOSED INITIAL PUBLIC OFFERING', 'text': 'ARLINGTON, VA., SEPT. 28, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FLUENCE, THE AES CORPORATION\'S JOINT VENTURE WITH SIEMENS, A LEADING PROVIDER OF ENERGY STORAGE PRODUCTS AND SERVICES AND DIGITAL APPLICATIONS FOR RENEWABLES AND STORAGE, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT FLUENCE ENERGY, INC. HAS FILED A REGISTRATION STATEMENT ON FORM S-1 WITH THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION ("SEC") RELATING TO A PROPOSED INITIAL PUBLIC OFFERING OF ITS CLASS A COMMON STOCK.'}